{"strongs": "H2354", "word": "חוּר", "translit": "chur", "root": "חוק", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Hur", "definition": "II. חוּר proper name, masculine (meaning dubious; compare Nabataean proper name חורו Nö in Eut p. 45 ) — 1. ᵐ5 Ωρ, named with Aaron as compan. of Moses Exod 17:10 ; Exod 17:12 ; Exod 24:14 (all E ). 2. ᵐ5 Ωρ, a Judahite Exod 31:2 = Exod 35:30 , compare Exod 38:22 (all P ) 1Chr 2:19 ; 1Chr 2:20 ; 1Chr 2:50 (on divinity of verse see Be VB ); also 1Chr 4:1 ; 1Chr 4:4 ; 2Chr 1:5 . 3. ᵐ5 Ουρ, a king of Midian Num 31:8 ; Josh 13:21 (both P ). 4. ᵐ5 L Εουρ ( B omitted) head of fam. of returned exiles Neh 3:9 . 5. בֶּןחֿוּר officer of Solomon 1Kgs 4:8 , see below בֵּן p. 122.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2642')\">BDB2642</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2354')\">H2354</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H1133')\">H1133</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2352')\">H2352</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2641')\">BDB2641</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2643')\">BDB2643</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>חוּר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (meaning dubious; compare Nabataean proper name <bdbheb>חורו</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Eut')\">Eut<sup>p. 45</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ωρ,</grk> named with Aaron as compan. of Moses <ref ref=\"Exod 17:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,10)\">Exod 17:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 17:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,12)\">Exod 17:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 24:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,14)\">Exod 24:14</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ωρ,</grk> a Judahite <ref ref=\"Exod 31:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,2)\">Exod 31:2</ref> = <ref ref=\"Exod 35:30\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,30)\">Exod 35:30</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Exod 38:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,22)\">Exod 38:22</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,19)\">1Chr 2:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:20\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,20)\">1Chr 2:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:50\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,50)\">1Chr 2:50</ref> (on divinity of verse see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('VB')\"><reflink>VB</reflink></lookup>); also <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,1)\">1Chr 4:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,4)\">1Chr 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,5)\">2Chr 1:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ουρ,</grk> a king of Midian <ref ref=\"Num 31:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,8)\">Num 31:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,21)\">Josh 13:21</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflin